 LOW  AES-128 · jvm.jca.aes-128 · vulnerable
  ──▶ src/main/java/com/acme/auth/AuthConfig.java:11:2
   │
11 │     generator.init(128);
   │     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
   │ AES-128 keeps only about 64 bits of security against Grover's algorithm
   = why: A 128-bit AES key detected.
